sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Assessor
    participant M as Mobile app
    participant L as Local database
    participant S as SAMAR API

    Note over M,L: Before the visit
    M->>S: requests assessment bundle
    S-->>M: returns parameters and questions
    M->>L: stores bundle for offline use

    Note over A,L: On site, no connectivity needed
    A->>M: punches in with photo
    M->>L: queues punch-in
    A->>M: records responses
    M->>L: queues each response
    A->>M: captures evidence
    M->>L: stores photo and queues upload

    Note over M,S: When connectivity returns
    M->>L: reads queued items in order
    M->>S: uploads each item
    S-->>M: confirms or rejects
    M->>L: marks item synced

    Note over M,S: Punch-out is held back
    M->>S: uploads punch-out last
    S-->>M: confirms assessment complete
